<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80360" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πειρητίζω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πειράω</span>, only
			pres. and impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>attempt, try, prove</i>, abs., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.615
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				24.221
			</span></i> : c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥήγνυσθαι μέγα τεῖχος . . πειρήτιζον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.257
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλήκτρῳ ἐπειρήτιζε</span>
			<i>touched the strings</i> with it, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				53
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				419
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. gen.
			pers., <i>make trial of</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συβώτεω
				πειρητίζων εἰ</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.459
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συβώτεω π., ἤ μιν ἔτ᾽
				ἐνδυκέως φιλέοι . . ἦ</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				15.304
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή τί μευ, ἠΰτε παιδός . . ,
					πειρήτιζε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.235
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σθένεος καὶ ἀλκῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					22.237
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.124
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				149
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> c. acc.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίχας ἀνδρῶν π</span>.
			<i>attempt</i>, i.e. <i>attack</i>, the lines, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				12.47
			</span></i>.</div>
